- Cash balance and runway (with scenario sensitivity)
- Net burn (cash outflow minus cash inflow) — monthly and rolling 3-month
- Revenue (MRR if relevant) and QoQ growth
- Gross margin and contribution margin
- CAC, LTV, and LTV:CAC
- Revenue per employee; OPEX as % of revenue
- Customer cohorts (retention/churn, churn dollar retention)
- Pipeline & backlog (sales visibility)

