- Draft an internal email to leadership summarizing the ask and attaching the memo/deck.
- Create a line-item P&L sensitivity model based on assumptions you approve.

Tell me:
1) Which burn/runway numbers are correct (burn = $62K or runway = 6 months?), and whether the $1.8M last quarter is net revenue.
