5) Long-term (>9 months) — scalable growth
- Build or buy a lightweight tech platform or partner network to enable repeatable delivery at lower marginal cost.
- Launch self-service or SaaS-like products for repeatable revenue (increases recurring revenue % and LTV).
- Expand into strategic channel partnerships to reduce incremental CAC.
- Data-driven marketing & lifecycle programs to reduce churn and increase ARPU.
Outcome: Operating leverage drives margin expansion as revenue scales.

