- “Profitably scale” — we are not just pursuing top-line growth, but increasing gross and contribution margins so growth produces positive cashflow.
- “Unit economics first” — every new customer must meet CAC payback and target LTV ratios.
- “Operationalize the business” — standardize delivery and automate to reduce marginal cost per dollar of revenue.
- “Liquidity and runway management” — transparent scenario planning and cost trigger points (e.g., if revenue dips X%, we enact Y cost saves).

