“Horizon Media is generating ~$600K of revenue per month with $1.2M of cash on hand. Our immediate priority is to solidify 12+ months of runway while investing in high-ROI growth that increases contribution margins. Over the next 90 days we will focus on tighten collections and working capital, stop non-essential spend, and test pricing and product-mix moves that improve gross margin. Over the next 6–12 months we’ll scale channels that lower CAC and productize services to reduce fulfillment costs. Expected outcome: a 6–12 point improvement in contribution margin and a materially lower net burn within two quarters.”

Prioritized margin-improvement levers (high impact first)
1. Improve gross margin (highest leverage)
   - Re-price top 25% of clients where value > price (target +3–7% price lift).
