- Standardize recurring contracts and move customers to subscription billing.
- Invest in automation (onboarding, reporting) to reduce fulfillment FTE per $ of revenue.
- Build a channel/partner program to scale sales without proportionate SDR headcount.
- Improve funnel conversion and shorten sales cycle (increases ARR with same pipeline inputs).

