- 5% price increase on recurring revenue: 600K * 5% = +$30K/mo = +$360K/year.
- Reduce delivery costs by $40K/mo by automating/outsourcing: +$40K/mo to contribution margin.
- Cut non-essential Opex by $50K/mo: immediate reduction in burn and runway extension.
