Executive finance narrative (short version)
- Current state: Horizon Media has $1.2M cash. Last quarter revenue was $1.8M (monthly run rate ≈ $600K). At current burn, runway is limited — we must prioritize margin improvements, operational scalability, and fundraising options to preserve optionality.
- Goal: Extend runway to >= 12 months while improving margins and building scalable revenue engines that enable 30–50% year-over-year growth without proportionate increases in fixed costs.
- Strategy pillars: 1) Immediate cash preservation (90 days), 2) Margin expansion (6–12 months), 3) Scalable growth engine (12+ months), and 4) Financing safety net only if required.

