  - If current burn = $200K and you cut burn by 20% → new burn = $160K → runway = 1.2M / 160K = 7.5 months (gain ~1.5 months).
  - If current burn = $62K and you reduce burn by 20% → new burn = $49.6K → runway ≈ 24.2 months (gain ~4.8 months).
