- Sales efficiency: tighten lead qualification, shorten sales cycle, redeploy SDR/AE time to top accounts.
- Reduce COGS: renegotiate supplier contracts, optimize fulfillment, move to more cost‑efficient vendors or SKU rationalization.
- Improve billing & collections: accelerate AR, shorten payment terms, implement incentives for faster payment.

Medium term / 3–12 months (scalability, sustainable margin)
- Productize services and automate delivery to reduce labor per sale.
- Build repeatable, standardized onboarding to lower support costs and churn.
- Invest in analytics and pricing experiments (A/B) to raise average order value and margin.
- Platform and architecture changes to reduce per‑customer cost as you scale (microservices, autoscaling, usage‑based cloud cost controls).
